    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk Israeli ku beer, ‹Ohme oohare' as aníng.› Kuúng kitangw'eé' wa ooheek dír umuúqo heewo ar adoodá' baraá muunaáwose ngira slaá' haniisaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohmér ta dir'ín wa ilaaot a tí: Sahaábu nee muqslár peésa nee muqslár sirda/aten, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee neewór taa tleéhh ar se'éngw bee/aangw ar kaloó sirboó/, nee ar sirda/aten, nee ar da/aten, nee kitaánír hhohho', nee neewór se'éngw aara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kadaá gwaandaawe awa taa da/teemiís, nee kadaá aara, nee peehhoó masqaryaán, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee di/tá tsaa'asi, nee muruudá' ta di/tá iimbalaxángwár aleedogiiti, nee mooyangwdá' tsuú' ta da/aa/an, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee tlaa/aá tlaxo gawden awa ta bay sardoniki, nee tlaa/aá hatlá' awa tlaxo gawden awa ta qaasi gawaá naifeéra, nee gawaá tlakoó da/eewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín dír hotaaeé' ngi tleehhiye', as kahhó' niwa baraá tla/angw'ín wa hoot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng heémár Mungú an tléhh ar xosluuká' sleémeero ar slaqsaywí ni kuúng i laqaqaam.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk Israeli sandakmo ngu tleehhiye' ar peehhoó masqaryaán. Tlenaangós a miíta wak nee sentimiíta mibaangw, bihheero uraywós a sentimiíta mibeeri lahhoó' nee lahhoó', baráy wa tleemu ay gawa a sentimiíta mibeeri lahhoó' nee lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng guruuwós nee daanduú tsee/aawo ki ninkiríts ar sahaábuú hhohhó', ku gangeefoó sahaábúy tléhh badu sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng duungoó tsiyáhh ti tlehh ar sahaábu, ku qás afi qoomár ya'aawós tsiyahhawo, duungoó tsár bartá wák, nee oo tsár bartá hatlá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng xaa'aá tsár awa masqaryaán tleehheek ar as loohisór Sandakmo, daqaní ki ninkiríts ar sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní xaaiisíng ki dahás baraá dungáydá' bihhe tsaraawo ar Sandakmo, as loohisór Sandakmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee xaaiisíng ki duuxiiká baraá dungáydae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní parhheemoodá' tsár awa tlaa/e awa hara'ayar'eé' koomá' ni kuúng i haniis ki qás baraá sandakmoodá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuúng kitángw gurtleemu ku tléhh ar sahaábuú hhohhó', tlenaangós a miíta wak nee sentimiíta mibaangw, uroó bihheero a sentimiíta mibeeri lahhoó' nee lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsa'aá tsár awa keruúbi ki tléhh ar sahaábuú taa kwahhuút, ki qás gawaá alhhe'eesoó badu tsaraawo awa kitangwduú gurtleemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keruúbír wák ka qás alhhe'eesayqá' nee tiqá' alhhe'eesayqá' oo kitángw gurtleemu. Inooín masók a gár wák nee kitaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsi'iidaá keruúbi hhampe'eeri'ín ngi gáwtí tleesiye' as kitangwduú gurtleemu nguwa mahhtírií tleehhiya' ar hhampe'eeri'ín, inooín ti gur'ér xu'usiye', nee gitsee/er'ín kitangwduú gurtleemu ngu ga/eer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitangwduú gurtleemu qaaseek gawaá daanduú sandakmo, daqaní tlaa/eedá' tsár awa parereehhayen, kudá' ni haniis awa hara'ayar'eé' koomá', ki baraadií qás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nee kuúng ti doogaán didár kitángw gurtleemu, tla/ángw slaqsa'aá tsár awa keruúbi, kudaá gawaá sandakmoó hara'aya, aníng nee kuúng a axweesaán nee hara'ayar'eé' sleémeero ngi dirók i haniís as múk Israeli.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuúng meésa an tléhh ar peehhoó masqaryaán, tlenaangós a sentimiíta mibeeri dakaát nee dakaát, uroó bihheero a sentimiíta mibeeri tsiyáhh nee tsiyáhh, baráy wa tleemu ay gawa a sentimiíta mibeeri lahhoó' nee lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meésaarí ka ninkiríts ar sahaábuú hhohhó', nee ka gangeefoó sahaábií tléhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng meésaari kari harwét bihhe sleémeero ar peehhír sentimiíta faanqw nee tlaqi ka ninkiríts ar sahaábu, nee ka gangefoó sahaábií tléhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duungoó tsiyáhh ku tléhh ar sahaábu nee ku qás afiqoomár ya'aá meésa, baduuwós tsiyahhaawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duungáydá' ku qás bihhaá peehhidá' ta harweér ar meésa, as kahhó' xaaiidá' meésa kar loohisi kiwa baraadií dahaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xaa'aá masqaryaán ki tléhh as kiwa meésárár loohisi, daqaní ki sahaábúr ninkiríts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sahaánaywós ku tléhh, nee tsukma'aá mooyángw tsuú', nee qoloqoloó ilahhooa tsipipi'iimis. Xosluuká' sleémeero ki tléhh ar sahaábuú hhohhó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng mikaátér Mungú ka qás umuú daqto gawaá meésaadá' dír geeraaeé' dirii'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuúng kitángw tsaa'aso ki qamin tleehheek ar sahaábuú hhohhó'. Yukumoó tsaa'astadá' nee hhartós tidá' aa gáwtí ganai a gár wák, nee slooqi'iiwose nee qoloqoláywose nee /ayoorose sleémeero tleehheek ar sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haleemaá lahhoó' ki tléhh gawaá hhartadá', awa tám bartá wák, awa hatlá' tám bartá tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá umuú ságw halmiro qoloqoloó tám tleehheek oo slaqamís nee /ayór ta bay loósi, umuú qoloqolto diqi ti tlehh nee /ayoorose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hhartós tidá' aa gáwtí gana', qoloqoloó tsiyáhh gawaawós ti tlehh oo slaqamís nee /ayór ta bay loósi, diqi ti tlehh nee /ayooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo dír haleemaá tsár niwa bihhér xu'uyé' bihhaá baraay diqito'oórí tleehheek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diqiyaaká' nee haleemidae nee hhartadae a gár wák sleémeero kin tleehh ar sahaábuú hhohhó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng tsaa'aso faanqw an tléhh as kitangwduú tsaa'aso, kari gawaadií qás as iwa geeraawós wa gwa/at. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee muqslaarós tidár ohiingw nee sahaánaywose ki tléhh ar sahaábuú hhohhó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitaangwuú tsaa'aso nee xosluuwós sleémeero gár kir tlehh a kílo mibeeri tám nee kooán ar sahaábuú hhohhó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magaáhh umuú gaaro tleehheek ar slaqsoó tidá' taa gawaá tloomár wa aán.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
